<title>SWITZERLAND: ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>CRANS MONTANA, Switzerland 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading</p>
<p>times after the first leg of a women's World Cup Alpine skiing</p>
<p>slalom on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Pernilla Wiberg (Sweden) 44.60 seconds</p>
<p>2. Claudia Riegler (New Zealand) 44.83</p>
<p>3. Patricia Chauvet (France) 45.24</p>
<p>4. Karin Roten (Switzerland) 45.41</p>
<p>5. Vanessa Vidal (France) 45.57</p>
<p>6. Sonja Nef (Switzerland) 45.58</p>
<p>7. Christelle Pascal (France) 45.96</p>
<p>8.  Anita Wachter (Austria) 46.05</p>
<p>9. Urska Hrovat (Slovenia) 46.07</p>
<p>10. Ylva Nowen (Sweden) 46.25</p>
</text>
